    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/3b4d7723c6362917fa61ab5276c0709c.poster.avif?t=1754397013\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/3b4d7723c6362917fa61ab5276c0709c.webm?t=1754397013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/3b4d7723c6362917fa61ab5276c0709c.mp4?t=1754397013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A sprawling, labyrinth stretches out ahead, steeped in shadow. Foes lurk behind every corner, but only through combat and perseverance can you endure. Death is but a lesson, you have no choice but to try again. And again. And again.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hand-crafted world as a forsaken triangle, and master how to take down formidable angular bosses in a minimalist, geometric gloom. On your quest to liberate a subjugated world, you will face off against sword-wielding grunts, devious arrow-flinging fiends, and brutal boss fights that will test your resolve. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/bbd4c449e47c30f728715f2d6c964f9a.poster.avif?t=1754397013\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/bbd4c449e47c30f728715f2d6c964f9a.webm?t=1754397013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/bbd4c449e47c30f728715f2d6c964f9a.mp4?t=1754397013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REFINE AND UNLEASH YOUR BUILD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire Sols by defeating enemies and exploring a world filled with challenges. Bonfires offer a brief respite in this unforgiving world and allow you to tailor and refine your build using your gathered Sols. Equip new weapons, alter your stats, and adapt to the challenges ahead. Just be sure to reclaim your Sols whenever you\u2019re bested by a foe\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/ec1352fd4508a25458b04556d140abf8.poster.avif?t=1754397013\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/ec1352fd4508a25458b04556d140abf8.webm?t=1754397013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/ec1352fd4508a25458b04556d140abf8.mp4?t=1754397013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A HAND-CRAFTED WORLD TEEMING WITH SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into a dark, abstract fantasy and discover the secrets of this world. Explore diverse biomes, illuminate every hidden nook to find rare items, secret paths, and the truth behind a world plunged into darkness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/f11784cf82c2dde2f65cb10f275de96c.poster.avif?t=1754397013\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/f11784cf82c2dde2f65cb10f275de96c.webm?t=1754397013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/f11784cf82c2dde2f65cb10f275de96c.mp4?t=1754397013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE FORMIDABLE FOES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Void Sols, every fight is a lesson - master your weapons, skills, and movement to take down challenging foes. Turn the tides in your favour by studying your enemies, exploiting their weaknesses, and using their own traps against them. Gain temporary allies, study your enemies\u2019 attack patterns, and perfect your timing in combat as you navigate this harsh land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/842b11ea70815ede461b198c5b40cdb9.poster.avif?t=1754397013\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/842b11ea70815ede461b198c5b40cdb9.webm?t=1754397013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/842b11ea70815ede461b198c5b40cdb9.mp4?t=1754397013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FORGE YOUR EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Sols is the perfect distillation of the souls-like genre. With a range of difficulty sliders, you can either ease your way into its unforgiving world as a newcomer to the genre or test your mettle against relentless challenges that will push even souls-like veterans to their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game contains certain light patterns and flashing lights that could trigger or cause discomfort for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you experience dizziness, altered vision, eye or muscle twitches, loss of awareness, disorientation, any involuntary movement, or convulsions while playing, please immediately discontinue playing Void Sols and consult your doctor.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/3b4d7723c6362917fa61ab5276c0709c.poster.avif?t=1754397013\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/3b4d7723c6362917fa61ab5276c0709c.webm?t=1754397013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/3b4d7723c6362917fa61ab5276c0709c.mp4?t=1754397013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A sprawling, labyrinth stretches out ahead, steeped in shadow. Foes lurk behind every corner, but only through combat and perseverance can you endure. Death is but a lesson, you have no choice but to try again. And again. And again.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hand-crafted world as a forsaken triangle, and master how to take down formidable angular bosses in a minimalist, geometric gloom. On your quest to liberate a subjugated world, you will face off against sword-wielding grunts, devious arrow-flinging fiends, and brutal boss fights that will test your resolve. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/bbd4c449e47c30f728715f2d6c964f9a.poster.avif?t=1754397013\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/bbd4c449e47c30f728715f2d6c964f9a.webm?t=1754397013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/bbd4c449e47c30f728715f2d6c964f9a.mp4?t=1754397013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span