m/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/f11784cf82c2dde2f65cb10f275de96c.mp4?t=1754397013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE FORMIDABLE FOES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Void Sols, every fight is a lesson - master your weapons, skills, and movement to take down challenging foes. Turn the tides in your favour by studying your enemies, exploiting their weaknesses, and using their own traps against them. Gain temporary allies, study your enemies\u2019 attack patterns, and perfect your timing in combat as you navigate this harsh land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/842b11ea70815ede461b198c5b40cdb9.poster.avif?t=1754397013\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/842b11ea70815ede461b198c5b40cdb9.webm?t=1754397013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736690/extras/842b11ea70815ede461b198c5b40cdb9.mp4?t=1754397013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FORGE YOUR EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Sols is the perfect distillation of the souls-like genre. With a range of difficulty sliders, you can either ease your way into its unforgiving world as a newcomer to the genre or test your mettle against relentless challenges that will push even souls-like veterans to their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game contains certain light patterns and flashing lights that could trigger or cause discomfort for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you experience dizziness, altered vision, eye or muscle twitches, loss of awareness, disorientation, any involuntary movement, or convulsions while playing, please immediately discontinue playing Void Sols and consult your doctor.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Death is but a lesson in the geometric gloom. Step into a hand-crafted souls-like as a forsaken triangle, carving your path through the remnants of this abstract fantasy. Fight powerful angular enemies and uncover twisted secrets as you liberate an oppressed world.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cOf all the games to tread in the wake of Dark Souls and Elden Ring, new indie souls-like game Void Sols might be one of the most distinctive and exciting.\u201d<br>PCGamesN<br><br>\u201cVoid Sols brings a really experimental spirit to the souls-like genre.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cWith its novel use of lighting, Void Sols distills the essence of Souls games into something minimalist and pure, but just as frightening. Perhaps the dawn of the Sols-like is upon us.\u201d<br>Eurogamer<br>",
